---
import '../styles/global.css';

// A separate manuscript for discussion. It does not drive the homepage or 3D journey.
// Source material: src/data/timeline.ts and docs/rebuild/28-canada-tour.md.
// Dates, ages, Bean's current status and the graduation chronology still need review.
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <title>Story draft | Vansh Sood</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="preload" as="font" type="font/woff2" href="/fonts/space-grotesk.woff2" crossorigin />
    <link rel="preload" as="font" type="font/woff2" href="/fonts/inter.woff2" crossorigin />
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="draft-nav">
      <a href="/">Back to portfolio</a>
      <span>First draft</span>
    </header>

    <main>
      <article aria-labelledby="story-title">
        <header class="opening">
          <h1 id="story-title">Hey, I'm Vansh.</h1>
          <p>
            I grew up in Delhi. Before I got into code, I spent a lot of time
            playing Call of Duty Zombies on my Xbox 360.
          </p>
        </header>

        <section aria-labelledby="school">
          <h2 id="school">Then I made a website.</h2>
          <p>
            I made it in our school computer lab using a W3Schools template.
            Mostly, I changed the colours. I kept making websites after that.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="google">
          <h2 id="google">My first trip out of India.</h2>
          <p>
            I started contributing to Drupal through Google Code-in and won a
            grand prize in 2018. Google flew me and my dad to California.
          </p>
          <p>That trip is what got me thinking about studying abroad.</p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="webcube">
          <h2 id="webcube">Back home, I started Webcube.</h2>
          <p>
            We built software for startups from my bedroom in Delhi. The team
            grew to 25 developers. We worked with companies across six countries.
            I kept running it through university.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="covid">
          <h2 id="covid">Then Delhi needed help.</h2>
          <p>
            During Covid, I helped build a site where people could find verified
            leads for hospital beds and oxygen. Covid Leads Delhi reached
            20,000 people in two months.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="halifax">
          <h2 id="halifax">I moved to Halifax for university.</h2>
          <p>
            I studied computer science at Dalhousie. Alongside classes, I worked
            on research projects and taught workshops at ShiftKey Labs.
          </p>
          <p>
            I also started Gig Empower to help other international students find
            freelance work.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="bean">
          <h2 id="bean">Pankrit and I started Bean.</h2>
          <p>
            We built a cooking app for busy parents. It started with helping
            people figure out what to make with the food already in their fridge.
          </p>
          <p>
            Part of that happened around a shared table in a hacker house in Sydney.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="road">
          <h2 id="road">We took it on the road.</h2>
          <p>
            I brought Bean to Web Summit in Vancouver. We had 500 conversations
            and 120 signups in a day. Invest Nova Scotia later backed us through
            its Accelerate program.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="customers">
          <h2 id="customers">There was still an app to work on.</h2>
          <p>
            In Toronto for Elevate, I booked investor meetings. Then I ended up
            in a cafe working on why people weren't coming back to Bean.
          </p>
          <p>I spent the next day on feedback calls with parents.</p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="collect">
          <h2 id="collect">We got people building together.</h2>
          <p>
            Back in Halifax, I helped start Collect. with Noah and Sam. We met at
            Volta every Thursday to work on our own projects. The group grew
            from a handful of people to almost a hundred.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="graduation">
          <h2 id="graduation">And I finished my degree.</h2>
          <p>I graduated from Dalhousie with a degree in computer science.</p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="floqer">
          <h2 id="floqer">These days, I'm at Floqer.</h2>
          <p>
            I joined as a founding engineer in October 2025. Now I lead
            engineering from Toronto. I build the engine that runs our
            customers' sales workflows.
          </p>
        </section>
      </article>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .draft-nav,
  main {
    width: min(100%, 960px);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: var(--pad);
  }

  .draft-nav {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px 24px;
    padding-block: 28px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .draft-nav span {
    color: var(--mut);
  }

  main {
    padding-block: clamp(56px, 9vw, 128px) clamp(96px, 12vw, 176px);
  }

  .opening,
  section {
    max-width: 820px;
  }

  section {
    margin-top: clamp(88px, 12vw, 160px);
    scroll-margin-top: 32px;
  }

  h1 {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 88px);
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4.2vw, 52px);
    line-height: 1.12;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  article p {
    max-width: 38ch;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 2.8vw, 34px);
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  article p + p {
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  @media print {
    .draft-nav {
      display: none;
    }

    main {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0;
    }

    section {
      margin-top: 36px;
      break-inside: avoid;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 32pt;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 20pt;
    }

    article p {
      max-width: none;
      font-size: 14pt;
    }
  }
</style>
